WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.054 --> 00:00:15.654
Bok Choy got more paper.

2
00:00:15.655 --> 00:00:20.377
"Let's make paper airplanes instead."

3
00:00:20.378 --> 00:00:23.911
"Okay!" Berry said.

4
00:00:23.912 --> 00:00:30.793
Cupcake sighed. "Okay."

5
00:00:30.794 --> 00:00:34.941
"Do what I do," Bok Choy said.

6
00:00:34.942 --> 00:00:42.004
He began to fold his paper.

7
00:00:42.005 --> 00:00:48.424
Berry worked slowly.

8
00:00:48.425 --> 00:00:53.541
Cupcake worked fast.

9
00:00:53.542 --> 00:00:58.596
"Slow down," Bok Choy said.

10
00:00:58.597 --> 00:01:06.481
"Bah!" Cupcake waved a hand.

11
00:01:06.482 --> 00:01:18.092
Finally they were done.

12
00:01:18.093 --> 00:01:31.176
Bok Choy's airplane flew far.

13
00:01:31.177 --> 00:01:40.558
Berry's airplane flew over a cup!

14
00:01:40.559 --> 00:01:48.191
"Yes!" He pumped his fists.

15
00:01:48.192 --> 00:01:56.873
"My turn!" Cupcake threw her plane.

16
00:01:56.874 --> 00:02:05.930
It crashed on the counter.

17
00:02:05.931 --> 00:02:17.277
"Grr!" Cupcake crushed her plane.

18
00:02:17.278 --> 00:02:23.975
Berry gasped. "Why did you do that?"

19
00:02:23.976 --> 00:02:34.857
Cupcake shrugged. "I didn't want it anymore."

20
00:02:34.858 --> 00:02:40.892
Berry threw his plane again.

21
00:02:40.893 --> 00:02:51.543
Cupcake watched.

22
00:02:51.544 --> 00:02:57.709
She bit her lip.

23
00:02:57.710 --> 00:03:05.113
Then she walked over to Berry.

24
00:03:05.114 --> 00:03:10.658
"Um, Berry?" Cupcake said sweetly.

25
00:03:10.659 --> 00:03:18.945
"Can I borrow your paper airplane?"

